# CODEOWNERS
#
# Defines review ownership for this repository. When a pull request touches
# files matching a pattern below, the listed owners are automatically requested
# for review. Pair this with a branch protection rule that requires review from
# Code Owners to enforce it.
#
# Rules are evaluated top to bottom; the LAST matching pattern wins. Keep the
# general default first and more specific overrides below it.
#
# Note: CODEOWNERS does not support line continuations — all owners for a
# pattern must sit on a single line.
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

